answer: start | smallest
wrong[0 | smallest]: With `smallest = 0`, every pass compares with index 0, in the sorted part. After pass 1 that's the smallest item of all, so nothing beats it, and the swaps move sorted items back out: [5, 1, 2, 3, 4].
